        "text": "Bond-graph quarter car (D28). SJ (1) = sprung mass IMs (I, 300 kg) + gravity MSeGs; UJ (1) = unsprung mass IMu (I, 40 kg) + gravity MSeGu. Suspension SpringDamper Susp (20 kN/m, 1500 N s/m) and hard stop Stop (-/+0.08 m) between UJ and SJ. Tire OneSidedSpring (200 kN/m) between the road junction RJ and UJ. The road is VelocitySource RoadV driven by the RoadProfile table: a 5 cm plateau bump (0.5 m/s for 0.1 s at 0.5 s, -0.5 m/s for 0.1 s at 1.5 s). FlowSensors and Integrators reconstruct the positions (sensor exception).",
